# The repository checks out with the same bytes on every platform (the same as
# headshell D-070).
#
# The index carries every file's sha256, and the client verifies what it
# downloads against it. If `core.autocrlf=true` on Windows turns a file into
# CRLF, `headshell plugin index` computes a different hash on that machine: the
# index contradicts the published bytes, and installation says "hash mismatch".
* text=auto eol=lf
